WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:06.896
Ringo and Bot flew to Sandstorm Planet.

2
00:00:06.897 --> 00:00:11.650
"I hope this mission goes fast," Ringo said.

3
00:00:11.651 --> 00:00:14.640
"I have to write my report.

4
00:00:14.641 --> 00:00:17.758
And I didn't choose a planet yet."

5
00:00:17.759 --> 00:00:22.306
"You can write about Sandstorm Planet," Bot said.

6
00:00:22.307 --> 00:00:28.782
"It has pretty seas and forests."

7
00:00:28.783 --> 00:00:31.975
Ringo scratched his head.

8
00:00:31.976 --> 00:00:35.603
"Why is it called 'Sandstorm Planet'?"

9
00:00:35.604 --> 00:00:40.145
"There are big sandstorms," Bot said.

10
00:00:40.146 --> 00:00:43.420
"The sandstorms are dangerous."

11
00:00:43.421 --> 00:00:46.447
"Uh-oh," Ringo said.

12
00:00:46.448 --> 00:00:50.864
"I hope Lucy is okay."

13
00:00:50.865 --> 00:00:53.496
Ringo tried to call Lucy.

14
00:00:53.497 --> 00:01:00.537
But she didn't answer.

15
00:01:00.538 --> 00:01:05.480
Bot looked for Lucy's ship. "I

16
00:01:05.481 --> 00:01:09.197
can't find a signal either," she said. "But

17
00:01:09.198 --> 00:01:19.404
I'm sure Lucy is okay." Soon

18
00:01:19.405 --> 00:01:26.306
they reached Sandstorm Planet. Bot

19
00:01:26.307 --> 00:01:31.550
flew low. "I

20
00:01:31.551 --> 00:01:36.344
see Lucy's ship!" Ringo said. Bot

21
00:01:36.345 --> 00:01:39.123
flew toward the ship. Sand

22
00:01:39.124 --> 00:01:42.760
covered part of it. "Oh

23
00:01:42.761 --> 00:01:45.535
no," Ringo said. "I

24
00:01:45.536 --> 00:01:48.375
think it crashed!" Bot

25
00:01:48.376 --> 00:01:51.408
tried to land the spaceship. Suddenly—

26
00:01:51.409 --> 00:01:54.163
whoosh!

27
00:01:54.164 --> 00:01:57.654
Sand flew toward them.

28
00:01:57.655 --> 00:02:04.019
Bot tried to fly away.

29
00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:08.488
"The storm is moving too fast!" Ringo cried.

30
00:02:08.489 --> 00:02:13.548
"We can't get away from it!"

